WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.631
This query creates a diagnosis summary materialized
view The

00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:11.688
result has one row per diagnosis It stores admission
count distinct

00:00:11.715 --> 00:00:17.238
patient count average stay and a refresh timestamp
The refresh

00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:23.093
timestamp documents when the snapshot was generated
It does not update

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:25.711
every time someone reads the materialized view
